# Local demo/test wiki workspaces (e.g. my-wiki/). The product output dirs
# /wiki/ and /sources/ above are root-anchored, so a nested workspace's
# my-wiki/wiki/ and my-wiki/sources/ would otherwise be tracked.
*-wiki/
docs/superpowers/
# Local Pi runtime state
.atl/

# Document upload scratch space. The KG package's suites write real files here
# through `createDocument`, and its own .gitignore covers them only under
# packages/llmwiki-kg/. This root entry is what stops one from being committed
# from the repo root — which is exactly how a 9-byte fixture ended up in
# d04fcc5 and had to be removed afterwards.
/uploads/

# CodeGraph index — a local analysis cache, regenerated on demand.
.codegraph/
